Error: Jet.ImmutableAssignment: `items` was made with `:`, so it can't be changed
  --> Tests/UI/iter_next_immutable_binding.jet:5:11
    |
  5 |     print(items.next())
    |           ^^^^^
 Why: `next: fn(^self)` changes the value it's called on, so `items` must be changeable (`^`)
 Fix: Add `^` before the name: `^items: ...`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.ImmutableAssignment
